STATEMENT OF CHANGES (LGPL-2.1 section 2a). This is a REDUCED SUBSET of upstream
1.2.6, obtained via the CMake-based fork at https://github.com/lhlmgr/lwpr. The
complete original is available from the Edinburgh URL above. Changes:

  * python/lwprmodule.c: the module init symbol was renamed from PyInit_lwpr to
    PyInit_pylwpr, so the extension imports as `pylwpr`. Marked in the file.
    No algorithmic change; every other source file is byte-identical to upstream.
  * CMakeLists.txt: build-script modifications (which COPYING exception 1
    states do not constitute a derivative work) -- the Python module is built by
    default, a target referencing an example directory the fork had already
    deleted was removed, Eigen was demoted from a hard requirement, and the
    install location of the Python module was made overridable.
  * README.TXT: the middle section, which described directories and build steps
    that do not exist in this subset, was rewritten and marked as ours. The
    upstream copyright, contact and warranty notices are untouched.
  * Removed relative to upstream: the MATLAB bindings, the autotools build
    files, the Python-2 setup scripts, the compiled documentation PDF, one
    example, and two files that carried no license grant at all.

Building it is optional: without it the LWPR baseline is skipped and every other
method still runs. See the README.

